{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114340","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"picture:0::1":{"text":"마법 통신기","source_cn":"魔法通讯器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x947F19C1A7611A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:0:1211434015:2":{"text":"후긴의 목소리가 갑자기 통신기에서 들려왔다...","source_cn":"呼金的声音突然从通讯器中传来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C8726C4EA7C68FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211434001:0":{"text":"도착했어? 대포의 모양을 좀 자세히 설명해 줄래?","source_cn":"你们到了？谁能给我详细描述一下那大炮的样子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DB858AF736DD8F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211434002:0":{"text":"음... 대포는 다 똑같이 생긴 거 아니었어? 위에 철판이 하나 있고, 엉덩이는 뾰족하고...","source_cn":"呃……炮不都长得差不多吗？它的上面有一块铁板，屁股是尖的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA48CF97D69A2A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211434003:0":{"text":"엉덩이가 뾰족하다고? 그럼 맞아! 내가 만든 대포야!","source_cn":"屁股是尖的？错不了！那是我造的炮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE840AD57A360D40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211434004:0":{"text":"정확하게는, 녀석들이 내 설계도를 훔쳐 가서 만든 대포지!","source_cn":"准确来说，是他们偷走了我的设计图以后自己造的炮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3694AE6BDA7DACD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211434005:0":{"text":"다른 건 몰라도 괴물의 촉수 몇 개는 폭발시킬 수 있을 거야! 놈들이 제대로 만들었다는 전제하에 말이지!","source_cn":"别的我不敢保证，但它起码能轰断那怪物几根触手！前提是他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2176121189CA639F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211434006:0":{"text":"그걸 내가 어떻게 알 수 있지?","source_cn":"这我怎么能看得出来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4B28AD0D9384807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1211434007:0":{"text":"걱정할 필요 없어. 난 내 설계도를 믿으니까!","source_cn":"你不需要多想，我相信我的设计图！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x890B3BD31EE62A0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1211434008:0":{"text":"신밧드, 체인호로 돌아오는 게 좋겠어. 우리는 외곽에서 대포를 쏘고, 죽음의 함대 놈들은 불사호에서 대포를 쏴서 중간에 있는 괴물을 명중시키는 거지!","source_cn":"辛巴达，你得回到枷锁号来，我们从外围开炮，让他们从不死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A3E1CA3FDB837A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1211434009:0":{"text":"이봐... 장난하는 거야? 내가 지금 바다에 뛰어들면 그냥 저 괴물의 뱃속으로 뛰어드는 거나 마찬가지라고!","source_cn":"伙计……你在开玩笑？我现在跳海等于直接跳进那怪物的胃里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E24BD0B290E66C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1211434010:0":{"text":"내가 좀 더 가까이 가서 갈고리를 쏠 테니까, 넌 그 밧줄을 따라 헤엄쳐 와!","source_cn":"我再靠近一点，射个钩锁过去，你顺着绳子荡过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x219572ABACD3DBC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1211434011:0":{"text":"꼭 그런 몹쓸 아이디어만 낸다니까!\n...알겠어! 여차하면 그냥 물고기 밥 되는 거지 뭐!","source_cn":"净出馊主意！\\n……行吧！大不了喂鱼呗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D1B9F07D6A92B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1211434012:1":{"text":"그런데 이 대포, 장전이 안 되어 있어. 포탄도 없는 것 같은데, 빈 대포로 뭘 어쩌겠다는 거야?","source_cn":"可是这炮没上膛，我们也没看到炮弹，两门空炮能炸出什么火花？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD808A3174CC455FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1211434013:0":{"text":"내 대포에는 특수한 탄약을 채워 넣어야 해. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너랑 소니아가 한 번 찾아봐. 분명 어딘가에 숨겨놨을 거야!","source_cn":"我的炮需要填充特殊弹药，<style=stress><...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC082033139378777","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내 대포에는 특수한 탄약을 채워 넣어야 해. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너랑 소니아가 한 번 찾아봐. 분명 어딘가에 숨겨놨을 거야!","female":"내 대포에는 특수한 탄약을 채워 넣어야 해. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너랑 소니아가 한 번 찾아봐. 분명 어딘가에 숨겨놨을 거야!","variant_male_record_index":"132293","variant_female_record_index":"132294","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1211434014:0":{"text":"괴물이 방금 소환된 터라 호드킨의 말도 잘 듣지 않고 날뛰고 있어. 서둘러야 해!","source_cn":"那怪物刚被召唤出来，似乎还很狂躁，不怎么听霍德希金的使...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FAFF51C224A21D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":3}}